# A prompt's card after a paste: a short paste, sent; a short paste of three
# lines with an empty one between, sent; a paste of more than a thousand
# characters on four lines, the third empty -- a block in the composer --
# sent; then the session resumed, its three cards replayed.
gateway paste-card-turns.json
wait 10
type look:
key Space
paste small pasted words
wait 1
key Enter
wait 5
snap small
paste first line\n\nthird line
wait 1
snap multi-composer
key Enter
wait 5
snap multi
paste \\n\
wait 2
snap large-composer
key Enter
wait 5
snap large
keep
type /quit
key Enter
wait 2
fx: relaunch --resume-last
xfx: relaunch --resume last
wait 8
snap resumed
snapfull end
gwlog
